{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42510","headline":"赠禅月大师 · 王锴","name":"赠禅月大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长爱吾师性自然，天心白月水中莲。\n神通力遍恒沙外，诗句名高八米前。\n寻访不闻朝振锡，修行唯说夜安禅。\n太平时节俱无事，莫惜时来话草玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王锴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}